{"id": "7th-t1-u3-279", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u3-naadu-samoogam-arasu", "lesson_id": "ta-l2-thevar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thevar-journal-name-direct", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பசும்பொன் முத்துராமலிங்கத்தேவர் தேசிய விடுதலைப் பணிக்காகத் தமது அரசியல் தலைவரின் பெயரில் நடத்திய வார இதழ் எது?"}], "options": {"A": "விவேகானந்தர்", "B": "பாரதி", "C": "நேதாஜி", "D": "சுதேசமித்திரன்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: முத்துராமலிங்கத்தேவர் 'நேதாஜி' என்னும் பெயரில் வார இதழை நடத்தி வந்தார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What was the name of the weekly journal run by Muthuramalingathevar named after his political mentor?"}], "options": {"A": "Vivekananda", "B": "Bharathi", "C": "Netaji (நேதாஜி)", "D": "Swadesamitran"}, "explanation": "Textbook fact: Thevar published and edited the weekly journal 'Netaji'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 53, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam":