{"id": "7th-t1-u3-332", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u3-naadu-samoogam-arasu", "lesson_id": "ta-l4-orezhuthu-oru-mozhi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "odd-peyar-pagaappatham", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கீழ்க்காண்பனவற்றுள் 'பெயர்ப் பகாப்பதம்' அல்லாத (பொருந்தாத) சொல் எது?"}], "options": {"A": "நிலம்", "B": "நீர்", "C": "காற்று", "D": "உண்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: நிலம், நீர், காற்று ஆகியன பெயர்ப் பகாப்பதங்கள்; 'உண்' என்பது தொழிலைக் குறிக்கும் வினைப் பகாப்பதம் ஆகும். எனவே 'உண்' பொருந்தாதது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following is NOT a Noun Pagaappatham (odd one out)?"}], "options": {"A": "Nilam", "B": "Neer", "C": "Kaatru", "D": "Un (eat)"}, "explanation": "Textbook fact: Nilam, Neer, Kaatru are Noun Pagaappatham; 'Un' (eat) is a Verb Pagaappatham. Thus 'Un' is the odd one out."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 62, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam":