{"id": "7th-t1-u3-334", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u3-naadu-samoogam-arasu", "lesson_id": "ta-l4-orezhuthu-oru-mozhi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "odd-tense-marker", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பகுபத உறுப்புகளுள் 'காலம் காட்டும் உறுப்பாக அமையாத' (பொருந்தாத) உறுப்பு எது?"}], "options": {"A": "த் (இறந்தகால இடைநிலை)", "B": "கிறு (நிகழ்கால இடைநிலை)", "C": "ப் (எதிர்கால இடைநிலை)", "D": "அன் (சாரியை)"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: த், கிறு, ப் ஆகியன முறையே இறந்தகாலம், நிகழ்காலம், எதிர்காலம் காட்டும் இடைநிலைகள் ஆகும். 'அன்' என்பது இடைநிலைக்கும் விகுதிக்கும் இடையே வரும் காலங்காட்டாத அசைச்சொல்லான சாரியை ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following Pagupatham constituents does NOT indicate tense (odd one out)?"}], "options": {"A": "th (Past tense infix)", "B": "kiru (Present tense infix)", "C": "p (Future tense infix)", "D": "an (Saariyai)"}, "explanation": "Textbook fact: Th, Kiru, and P are tense infixes (past, present, future). 'An' is an expletive particle (Saariyai) which does not convey tense."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Cor