{"id": "7th-t1-u3-336", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u3-naadu-samoogam-arasu", "lesson_id": "ta-l4-orezhuthu-oru-mozhi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "orezhuthu-modern-count", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஏழாம் வகுப்புத் தமிழ் பாடநூலின்படி, நன்னூலார் கூறிய 42 ஓரெழுத்து ஒருமொழிகளுள் தற்காலத்தில் பெருமளவு வழக்கில் உள்ளவை எத்தனை?"}], "options": {"A": "12", "B": "15", "C": "17", "D": "21"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: ஆ, ஈ, கை, சீ, தா, தீ, தை, நா, நீ, பா, பூ, பை, போ, மா, மை, வா, வை ஆகிய 17 ஓரெழுத்துச் சொற்கள் மட்டுமே தற்காலத்தில் பெருமளவு வழக்கில் உள்ளன எனப் பாடநூல் கூறுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to the 7th standard Tamil textbook, how many of the 42 single-letter words stated in Nannool are widely in usage in modern times?"}], "options": {"A": "12", "B": "15", "C": "17", "D": "21"}, "explanation": "Textbook fact: The textbook states that only 17 single-letter words (Aa, Ee, Kai, See, Thaa, Thee, Thai, Naa, Nee, Paa, Poo, Pai, Po, Maa, Mai, Vaa, Vai) are widely used today."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "