{"id": "7th-t1-u3-361", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u3-naadu-samoogam-arasu", "lesson_id": "ta-l5-thirukkural-iraimaatchi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kural-six-organs-odd", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "வள்ளுவர் 'இறைமாட்சி' அதிகாரத்தில் அரசனுக்குரிய 'ஆறு அங்கங்களாக'க் குறிப்பிட்டவற்றுள் இல்லாத (பொருந்தாத) ஒன்று எது?"}], "options": {"A": "கூழ் (உணவு / செல்வம்)", "B": "மணி (நவரத்தின அணிகலன்கள்)", "C": "அமைச்சு (அமைச்சரவை)", "D": "அரண் (பாதுகாப்புக் கோட்டை)"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: 'படைகுடி கூழ்அமைச்சு நட்பரண் ஆறும் உடையான் அரசருள் ஏறு'. ஆறு அங்கங்கள்: படை, குடி, கூழ், அமைச்சு, நட்பு, அரண். 'மணி' என்பது இதில் இடம்பெறாத பொருந்தாத சொல்லாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following is NOT one of the six royal constituents enumerated by Valluvar in 'Iraimaatchi' (odd one out)?"}], "options": {"A": "Koozh (Wealth/Food)", "B": "Mani (Jewels/Gemstones)", "C": "Amaitchu (Ministry)", "D": "Aran (Fortress)"}, "explanation": "Textbook fact: The six elements are army, subjects, wealth, ministers, allies, and fort. 'Mani' (gems) is not one of them, hence the odd one out."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer K