{"id": "7th-t1-u3-364", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u3-naadu-samoogam-arasu", "lesson_id": "ta-l5-thirukkural-iraimaatchi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "three-royal-qualities-count", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திருக்குறள் இறைமாட்சி அதிகாரத்தின்படி, நாடாளும் மன்னனுக்கு 'ஒருபோதும் நீங்காமல் இருக்க வேண்டிய' நற்குணங்கள் எத்தனை என வள்ளுவர் வகுத்துள்ளார்?"}], "options": {"A": "இரண்டு", "B": "நான்கு", "C": "மூன்று (தூங்காமை, கல்வி, துணிவுடைமை)", "D": "ஐந்து"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: 'தூங்காமை கல்வி துணிவுடைமை இம்மூன்றும் நீங்கா நிலன்ஆள் பவர்க்கு' என்று மூன்று நற்குணங்களை வள்ளுவர் குறிப்பிட்டுள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to the chapter 'Iraimaatchi' in Thirukkural, how many virtues must 'never depart' from a ruler ruling the realm?"}], "options": {"A": "Two", "B": "Four", "C": "Three (Promptness, Learning, Boldness)", "D": "Five"}, "explanation": "Textbook fact: Valluvar stipulates exactly three qualities (promptness, learning, bold resolve) that must never depart from a ruler."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class":